1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,662
How long does an Oracle implementation take?

2
00:00:03,662 --> 00:00:08,314
It depends on scope, so start from the date it has to work.

3
00:00:09,014 --> 00:00:19,580
For in-scope businesses below fifty million dirhams in revenue, e-invoicing must be implemented by the first of July, twenty twenty-seven.

4
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:24,481
If a new system will send those invoices, that's your end date.

5
00:00:25,181 --> 00:00:35,425
In this hypothetical plan for a trading business, design runs to January and data migration to March, when the provider is appointed.

6
00:00:35,425 --> 00:00:42,589
Testing takes April, May is a parallel close of the April books, and June is kept as buffer.

7
00:00:43,289 --> 00:00:46,704
Planning an Oracle project for twenty twenty-seven?

8
00:00:46,704 --> 00:00:50,521
Send us a WhatsApp, and we'll map the timeline with you.
